prompt:
Use case: ui-mockup. Asset: ui_chart variant A. One complete nautical campaign chart screen, widescreen16:9 2048x1152 composition. Original hand-drawn narrative game art: digital opaque gouache painting with bold expressive black ink contours, outer silhouette heaviest and internal lines finer, visibly irregular brush edges. Elongated angular adult anatomy, vivid character expression and dramatic readable poses. Strong chiaroscuro with large crisp flat shadow shapes, no soft airbrushed modeling. Limited character colors against dark ink-navy sea-gray backdrops; saturated rimlight on one side, undead cyan-green soulfire and royal ivory-gold sunlight. Maintain selective painted strokes, clean value grouping and readable silhouettes. Absolutely no 3D render look, no low-poly triangular faceting, no photorealism, no plastic surfaces, no chibi proportions except explicitly requested tiny battle troops. No names or references to existing games, studios, artists, logos or watermarks.
Aged warm gray-ochre PARCHMENT sea chart occupies LEFT 73 percent within a dark navy forged-iron surround with fine aged GOLD/BRONZE insets. RIGHT27 percent is an INK-NAVY location information panel. Hand-drawn dark ink coastline, hatching, tidal swirls and selective visible dry brush. Ink sea is darker washed parchment than ivory land. Distinct islands and passages, a compass rose in lower-left, no unnecessary invented text or fantasy creatures. Keep coastline ink and parchment painterly, no 3D relief or photoreal old paper. Characters absent; if a tiny portrait appears it must be angular adult ink style, not chibi. The universal lighting language is cyan-green undead and ivory-gold royal; use only small restrained accents in this map.
Title top-left exact "王冠海航路". Show EXACTLY12 distinct labeled nodes, not a whole campaign:
"沉钟湾" upper far left, cyan-green selected-hub dot;
"断桅滩" just southeast of hub, GREEN hand-painted dot;
"天涯灯塔" below-left of wreck, GREEN dot with tiny ink lighthouse sketch;
"折桨港" below lighthouse, YELLOW dot;
"沉王群像" lower middle-left, YELLOW dot with tiny half-submerged statue;
"引航岛" upper middle, YELLOW dot selected by a thin cyan-green ring;
"锁海之门" upper middle-right, PURPLE SHIELD-SHAPED BOSS CREST with a small military COMMAND PENNANT symbol inside, based on a marshal's practical command flag, not a new family crest;
"黑浪船厂" upper right of map, ORANGE dot;
"王冠海道" center-right, ORANGE dot;
"白港门" lower right of map, RED dot;
"雄狮门" just above and right of Whiteport gate, RED dot;
"永昼王城" far-right map edge, ivory-gold sun/crown destination emblem.
Space labels so none collide with coastlines or one another. Chinese names must match exactly, no duplicates, no extra locations.
Dashed thin dark-ink sea ROUTES, with small direction arrowheads; routes ONLY:
沉钟湾→断桅滩;
断桅滩→天涯灯塔 and 引航岛;
天涯灯塔→折桨港 and 沉王群像;
折桨港→沉王群像;
引航岛→锁海之门 and 沉王群像;
锁海之门→黑浪船厂 and 王冠海道;
沉王群像→王冠海道;
黑浪船厂→雄狮门;
王冠海道→白港门 and 雄狮门;
白港门→永昼王城; 雄狮门→永昼王城.
No routes inventing different geography.
RIGHT PANEL: dark ink-blue, thin bronze frame with rope/nail corners, generous readable ivory typography. At top a small hand-inked landscape vignette of 2 chart huts linked by a tidal causeway, overcast gray sea, cyan-green route accent. Below exact Chinese text, visually separated:
"引航岛"
"战斗 · 难度：中"
"夺取潮汐堤道连接的两处海图房。"
"奖励：引航"
"灵活布置登陆点"
Bottom a restrained bronze-bordered button "驶向此地".
Bottom of map a clean legend with HAND-PAINTED COLOR DABS in green, yellow, orange, red and purple; exact labels "低" "中" "高" "极高" "首领". Boss is clearly purple plus heraldic shield, never red only. Typography clean and contrast high, muted parchment avoids washing out the dark narrative UI. No English, no logos, no extra lore text. ONE image.
